     "id": "notes-1",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "t": "prose",
       "md": "The model behind [AR(1) Impulse Response](note:ar-1-impulse-response). Place that view, not this note."
      },
      {
       "t": "prose",
       "md": "- **Model.** [Autoregressive Model](note:autoregressive-model): $x_t = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1 x_{t-1} + \\varepsilon_t$ with $\\beta_0 = \\mu(1 - \\beta_1)$, so the series sits at $\\mu$ until a shock hits; the shock then decays as $\\beta_1^k\\varepsilon$. At $\\beta_1 = 1$ there is a unit root ([Stationarity and Unit Roots](note:stationarity-and-unit-roots)).\n- **Tests.** Python."
      }
     ],
     "words": 45,
     "symbols": [
